---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
        title="About — Means+Measures"
        description="Means+Measures holds to two things: equity of means and equality of measures. Institutions bear responsibility down through systems; authority rises up through people."
>
    <section class="section">
        <h1 class="hero-title">
            Equity of means. Equality of measures.
        </h1>
        <hr class="gold-bar" />

        <div class="measure">
            <dl class="principles">
                <dt>Equity of means</dt>
                <dd>That lack of privilege is not lack of access.</dd>

                <dt>Equality of measures</dt>
                <dd>That impacts are judged on their own merits, not the standing of those responsible.</dd>
            </dl>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section section--compact" aria-labelledby="about-directions">
        <div class="measure">
            <h2 id="about-directions">Down through systems. Up through people.</h2>

            <p>
                Institutions bear responsibility down through systems for making the means of participation accessible.
            </p>

            <p>
                Authority rises up through people who question, evaluate, and hold those institutions accountable.
            </p>

            <p>
                The work follows from those two sentences. We build infrastructure, data systems, and analysis
                that keep the way in open: directories people can use tonight, records that can be checked
                without asking permission, and governance that leaves a decision reconstructable by the person
                it landed on.
            </p>

            <p>
                We stand with the people already doing the work. Means+Measures does not frame institutional repair as replacement or disruption for its own sake. It names what is broken without theatre.
            </p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section section--compact section--column" aria-labelledby="about-entity">
        <div class="measure">
            <h2 id="about-entity">The organization</h2>

            <p>
                Means+Measures is the public name of Means and Measures LLC. It continues the work previously published as CivicBrands by BJL13 Enterprise Solutions LLC. The work is editorial, infrastructural, and document-forward.
            </p>

            <p>
                Entity facts, identifiers, and capability documents are on the <a href="/procurement">procurement</a> page.
                Names, logo, type, and color are on the <a href="/brand">brand reference</a>.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid">
            <a href="/systems">
                <h2 class="card-title">Systems</h2>
                <p>What is built and running.</p>
            </a>

            <a href="/artifacts">
                <h2 class="card-title">Artifacts</h2>
                <p>Documents and records.</p>
            </a>

            <a href="/research">
                <h2 class="card-title">Research</h2>
                <p>Analysis and writing.</p>
            </a>

            <a href="/contact">
                <h2 class="card-title">Contact</h2>
                <p>Direct inquiry and coordination.</p>
            </a>
        </div>
    </section>
</BaseLayout>
